Dear {{contact_name}},

Thank you for raising an e-waste collection request with Urbeno.

Your request {{request_id}} dated {{request_date}} for {{site_name}} has been received and accepted. Our operations team will attend to it shortly and will confirm the pickup schedule with you.

Request summary
  Request ID     : {{request_id}}
  Site           : {{site_name}}
  Location       : {{location}}
  Approx. weight : {{approx_weight}} kg
  Approx. units  : {{approx_qty}}

Track this request in Urb TecTrack: {{portal_url}}

Questions? {{contact_email}}

Warm regards,
Urbeno Private Limited
Recycling Heroes™

A new e-waste collection request has been raised and is waiting to be acknowledged.

  Request ID     : {{request_id}}
  Client         : {{client_name}} ({{client_code}})
  Site           : {{site_name}}
  Pickup address : {{location}}
  Raised on      : {{request_date}}
  Raised by      : {{raised_by}} <{{raised_email}}>
  Site contact   : {{site_contact}} · {{site_phone}}
  Approx. weight : {{approx_weight}} kg
  Approx. units  : {{approx_qty}}

  Client notes   : {{notes}}

Open the request in Urb TecTrack to acknowledge it, or reply to the client with any change you need. The client is not notified until someone acknowledges, so please action this promptly.

{{portal_url}}

Urb TecTrack automated alert

Dear {{contact_name}},

Your e-waste collection request has been submitted to Urbeno.

  Request ID     : {{request_id}}
  Site           : {{site_name}}
  Pickup address : {{location}}
  Request date   : {{request_date}}
  Approx. weight : {{approx_weight}} kg
  Approx. units  : {{approx_qty}}

Our operations team will review and acknowledge your request shortly.

Track progress: {{portal_url}}
Questions? {{contact_email}}

Warm regards,
Urbeno Private Limited
Recycling Heroes™

Dear {{contact_name}},

Loading has been completed and weighment documentation is ready for your request {{request_id}} at {{site_name}}.

  Total net weight : {{net_weight}} kg
  Vehicles         : {{vehicle_count}}

Invoicing will proceed next.

Track your request: {{portal_url}}
Questions? {{contact_email}}

Warm regards,
Urbeno Private Limited

Dear {{contact_name}},

An invoice and e-way bill have been generated for your request {{request_id}}.

  Invoice   : {{invoice_no}}
  E-way bill: {{eway_bill_no}}
  Billed    : {{billing_weight}} kg
  Amount    : {{invoice_total}}

View in Urb TecTrack: {{portal_url}}
Questions? {{contact_email}}

Warm regards,
Urbeno Private Limited

Dear {{contact_name}},

Material for request {{request_id}} has been received at our facility.

  MRN     : {{mrn_no}}
  Invoice : {{invoice_no}}
  Facility: {{factory_name}}

Track progress: {{portal_url}}
Questions? {{contact_email}}

Warm regards,
Urbeno Private Limited

Dear {{contact_name}},

Recycling has been completed and Form 6 has been issued for request {{request_id}}.

  Form 6  : {{form6_no}}
  Invoice : {{invoice_no}}

View documents: {{portal_url}}
Questions? {{contact_email}}

Warm regards,
Urbeno Private Limited

Dear {{contact_name}},

The Certificate of Destruction has been uploaded for request {{request_id}}.

  Certificate : {{cert_no}}
  Invoice     : {{invoice_no}}
  Date        : {{cert_date}}

Please review and acknowledge closure in your portal when ready:
{{portal_url}}

Questions? {{contact_email}}

Warm regards,
Urbeno Private Limited

Dear {{contact_name}},

The Certificate of Destruction for your e-waste submission is now available and attached to this email.

  Request ID       : {{request_id}}
  Invoice          : {{invoice_no}}
  Certificate No.  : {{cert_no}}
  Certificate Date : {{cert_date}}
  Covers           : {{department}}
  Net weight       : {{net_weight}} kg

Where a single pickup covers more than one department, you will receive a separate certificate for each — please review them all before closing.

Please review the attached certificate and acknowledge closure in Urb TecTrack:
{{portal_url}}

Questions? {{contact_email}}

Warm regards,
Urbeno Private Limited
Recycling Heroes™

Dear {{contact_name}},

This is a reminder that the following invoice is outstanding.

  Request ID     : {{request_id}}
  Invoice        : {{invoice_no}} dated {{invoice_date}}
  Invoice value  : {{invoice_total}}
  Received       : {{amount_paid}}
  Outstanding    : {{amount_due}}
  Payment terms  : {{payment_terms}}
  Due date       : {{due_date}}
  {{overdue_line}}

Please arrange payment at your earliest convenience. If payment has already been made, share the UTR and we will reconcile it against this invoice.

Note that a request cannot be closed in Urb TecTrack until the invoice against it is fully settled.

Questions? {{contact_email}}

Warm regards,
Urbeno Private Limited
Recycling Heroes™

Internal SLA alert.

  Request        : {{request_id}}
  Invoice        : {{invoice_no}}
  Client         : {{client_name}}
  Material received : {{received_date}}
  Target for certificate : {{target_date}}
  Days elapsed   : {{days_used}} of {{sla_days}}
  Status         : {{sla_state}}

The clock runs from receipt of material at the facility to issue of the Certificate of Destruction.

